@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

autonumber

actor User
participant System
database "Local Storage\n(JSON / SQLite)" as Storage

== Request Task Creation ==

User -> System: Request to create a new academic task
System --> User: Display task creation form (for logged-in user)

== Enter Task Information ==

User -> System: Enter title, description, and deadline
opt Estimated hours entered
    User -> System: Enter estimated hours
else Not specified
    System -> System: Default estimated hours to 10
end
opt Difficulty selected (fixed choices only)
    User -> System: Select difficulty level
else Not specified
    System -> System: Default difficulty to Average
end

== Submit and Validate ==

alt User submits task
    User -> System: Submit task information
    System -> System: Validate entered information

    alt Hours not positive, or completion % not in [0, 100]
        System --> User: Error message, request valid value
    else Deadline invalid or missing
        System --> User: Error message, task not saved
    else Information valid
        == Save Task ==
        System -> System: Assign unique ID, set progress to 0%
        System -> Storage: Save new task
        Storage --> System: Save successful
        System --> User: Confirm task successfully created
    end

else User cancels task creation
    == Cancel Task Creation ==
    User -> System: Cancel task creation
    System --> User: Pop up window to confirm cancellation
    User -> System: Confirm cancellation
    System -> System: Discard unsaved task
    System --> User: Task not saved, use case ends
end

@enduml